message: "If you use these skills, please cite them as below."
title: "Coding-Agent Skills for Data Science"
abstract: "Agent Skills (SKILL.md folders) that teach AI coding agents to do whole data-science jobs the way a research team does them. The first, wri-html-pages, turns any data-visualization request into an interactive HTML page in a house style, checks every panel for statistical rigor and on a phone, publishes it to a GitHub Pages site, and links it."
